\f1\b0 \cf0 These packages are intended for mass deployment in organizations, e.g. through MDM systems. \
\
With these packages, 
\f0\b no TeamViewer windows are opened
\f1\b0  after installation. For the full TeamViewer client, the 
\f0\b Start with macOS setting will be on by default
\f1\b0  (this is the recommended setup for the full TeamViewer client on managed devices).\
\
After installation, the device can be assigned (managed) using the scripts provided in the 
\f2 Examples/
\f1  folder.\
\
